(6852399, 1031546, 93565, '<td valign="top">Interesting take. The strength of this photo is in its simplicity. Nice distance implied from the fading hills and only the rails are illuminated. You''re probably getting hammered for the blacks being all blocked up, but I like this. Plus you didn''t mention "around the bend" or use a guitar or a musician or a couple.</td>', 'Interesting take. The strength of this photo is in its simplicity. Nice distance implied from the fading hills and only the rails are illuminated. You''re probably getting hammered for the blacks being all blocked up, but I like this. Plus you didn''t mention "around the bend" or use a guitar or a musician or a couple.', '2012-08-30 12:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852400, 1031518, 93565, '<td valign="top">Thank god you didn''t say "end of the line." A composition that has been changed up from the others in this one, the toning is nice, fits the subject, and is fitting but not overbearing either. Great entry here.</td>', 'Thank god you didn''t say "end of the line." A composition that has been changed up from the others in this one, the toning is nice, fits the subject, and is fitting but not overbearing either. Great entry here.', '2012-08-30 12:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6852402, 1031551, 93565, '<td valign="top">Okay, so photographically, there are a lot of things wrong here, but you know that, and don''t care.<br/>This entry elicited a legit laugh from me as soon as it came up, and I think a large part of a photo is in its connection to the viewer, so you''re getting a good vote.</td>', 'Okay, so photographically, there are a lot of things wrong here, but you know that, and don''t care.This entry elicited a legit laugh from me as soon as it came up, and I think a large part of a photo is in its connection to the viewer, so you''re getting a good vote.', '2012-08-30 12:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
