(6855688, 1031297, 150868, '<td valign="top">How about "Lonely tracks" or "Forgotten Tracks" or "Tracks of Time".  Of course they are tracks.  Can you describe the tracks?  What message are you trying to portray?  Black &amp; white represents timelessness or the past since color photography didn''t exist 50+ years ago.  This bridge looks to be around 100 years old.  Were these passenger tracks or cargo tracks?  The title of an image can set the mood of the photo and vice versa.  The image is perfect but the title doesn''t give it any story to tell.  The title makes the image just look like a forgettable snapshot.</td>', 'How about "Lonely tracks" or "Forgotten Tracks" or "Tracks of Time".  Of course they are tracks.  Can you describe the tracks?  What message are you trying to portray?  Black & white represents timelessness or the past since color photography didn''t exist 50+ years ago.  This bridge looks to be around 100 years old.  Were these passenger tracks or cargo tracks?  The title of an image can set the mood of the photo and vice versa.  The image is perfect but the title doesn''t give it any story to tell.  The title makes the image just look like a forgettable snapshot.', '2012-09-03 21:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855691, 1031614, 150868, '<td valign="top">I hope she doesn''t wait too long or she''ll get run over.  No station platform for her to wait on even if it were an abandoned station? If she was wearing worn out clothing, old t-shirt and tattered jeans and cheap shoes then I could imagine she''s running away and more believable but she''s well dressed and she kind of blends in to the rest of the image; not much contrast between the person and the tracks. She''s very pretty. This image doesn''t do her justice. The vintage suitcases don''t match her clothing style.</td>', 'I hope she doesn''t wait too long or she''ll get run over.  No station platform for her to wait on even if it were an abandoned station? If she was wearing worn out clothing, old t-shirt and tattered jeans and cheap shoes then I could imagine she''s running away and more believable but she''s well dressed and she kind of blends in to the rest of the image; not much contrast between the person and the tracks. She''s very pretty. This image doesn''t do her justice. The vintage suitcases don''t match her clothing style.', '2012-09-03 21:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855694, 1031576, 150868, '<td valign="top">sunday night? Looks daylight to me.  How about "Afternoon Ride" or Morning Ride".  Nice motion effect but it makes it look like everything is in motion, even the bridge, like you''re on the end of the train moving in the opposite direction. I''m sure that''s a photoshop motion setting. Try this shot again with the camera on a lower tripod and the shutter open 1/2 to 1 second as bike riders are riding by.</td>', 'sunday night? Looks daylight to me.  How about "Afternoon Ride" or Morning Ride".  Nice motion effect but it makes it look like everything is in motion, even the bridge, like you''re on the end of the train moving in the opposite direction. I''m sure that''s a photoshop motion setting. Try this shot again with the camera on a lower tripod and the shutter open 1/2 to 1 second as bike riders are riding by.', '2012-09-03 21:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855697, 1030782, 150868, '<td valign="top">Is this where the people climb all over the train to ride it?  Great image.  The people seem to have no concern of the approaching train.</td>', 'Is this where the people climb all over the train to ride it?  Great image.  The people seem to have no concern of the approaching train.', '2012-09-03 21:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855702, 1031047, 150868, '<td valign="top">The ''Road Less Traveled'' can certainly have its beautiful moments.  Nice image. Also nice that it wasn''t photoshopped to death.</td>', 'The ''Road Less Traveled'' can certainly have its beautiful moments.  Nice image. Also nice that it wasn''t photoshopped to death.', '2012-09-03 21:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855719, 1031436, 150868, '<td valign="top">The title kills this image.  Where''s the owner of this guitar? Why isn''t he/she sitting on the track strumming their broken heart away?  This is just a snapshot. No editing at all. Looks like your camera was set on automatic or you used your phone?  Here''s an idea: Get an old man with aged hands holding the guitar as if he''s playing, and set him on the tracks. Use a wide angle lens and crop in close on the picking hand and allow image to flow out following the tracks. Aim the neck of the guitar away from the camera like the tracks moving away from the viewer.  How about a homeless looking person carrying the guitar over his shoulder walking away from the camera?  Try some imagination.</td>', 'The title kills this image.  Where''s the owner of this guitar? Why isn''t he/she sitting on the track strumming their broken heart away?  This is just a snapshot. No editing at all. Looks like your camera was set on automatic or you used your phone?  Here''s an idea: Get an old man with aged hands holding the guitar as if he''s playing, and set him on the tracks. Use a wide angle lens and crop in close on the picking hand and allow image to flow out following the tracks. Aim the neck of the guitar away from the camera like the tracks moving away from the viewer.  How about a homeless looking person carrying the guitar over his shoulder walking away from the camera?  Try some imagination.', '2012-09-03 21:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855720, 1031535, 150868, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool.  A black &amp; white ghost would be cool too.</td>', 'Pretty cool.  A black & white ghost would be cool too.', '2012-09-03 22:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855721, 1031244, 150868, '<td valign="top">Nice title and image.</td>', 'Nice title and image.', '2012-09-03 22:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855725, 1031428, 150868, '<td valign="top">Great title and image.  It''s nice to see a title directly tied into the image to help tell the story. So many people on this website just don''t understand this concept. Maybe they''ll learn from great story tellers like you.</td>', 'Great title and image.  It''s nice to see a title directly tied into the image to help tell the story. So many people on this website just don''t understand this concept. Maybe they''ll learn from great story tellers like you.', '2012-09-03 22:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855727, 1031516, 150868, '<td valign="top">Confusing image. The angle is wrong. It''s difficult distinguish between the two trains. It looks like just one train. A perpendicular angle showing one train on the left of the image and the other on the right would match the title better. I had to look at this a long time to figure out what the title meant.</td>', 'Confusing image. The angle is wrong. It''s difficult distinguish between the two trains. It looks like just one train. A perpendicular angle showing one train on the left of the image and the other on the right would match the title better. I had to look at this a long time to figure out what the title meant.', '2012-09-03 22:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855728, 1031529, 150868, '<td valign="top">Not many people would know what ''Stechelberg'' means. I had to Google it. Still it doesn''t really describe the image.</td>', 'Not many people would know what ''Stechelberg'' means. I had to Google it. Still it doesn''t really describe the image.', '2012-09-03 22:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855729, 1031603, 150868, '<td valign="top">Very nice title and image.</td>', 'Very nice title and image.', '2012-09-03 22:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855732, 1031359, 150868, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the title tells the story of the men here. what is the person on the left doing with his camera?  The lighting is perfect; very emotional but the title kills this emotion. The image is perfect but try another title.</td>', 'Not sure if the title tells the story of the men here. what is the person on the left doing with his camera?  The lighting is perfect; very emotional but the title kills this emotion. The image is perfect but try another title.', '2012-09-03 22:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855733, 1031487, 150868, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field.</td>', 'Great depth of field.', '2012-09-03 22:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855734, 1031446, 150868, '<td valign="top">Super cool.  Looks ghostly so the title has a double meaning here. Great title for this. Looks like a cover image for a great novel.</td>', 'Super cool.  Looks ghostly so the title has a double meaning here. Great title for this. Looks like a cover image for a great novel.', '2012-09-03 22:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855735, 1031455, 150868, '<td valign="top">How about a title like: "Risky Kids" or something like that. Or crop out the sign completely and come up with another title regarding a journey with young friends. The American movie "Lean On Me" comes to mind.</td>', 'How about a title like: "Risky Kids" or something like that. Or crop out the sign completely and come up with another title regarding a journey with young friends. The American movie "Lean On Me" comes to mind.', '2012-09-03 22:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855740, 1031360, 150868, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title. Is he suicidal? Nothing to live for?</td>', 'I don''t get the title. Is he suicidal? Nothing to live for?', '2012-09-03 22:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855741, 1031320, 150868, '<td valign="top">Perfect!!! title and image.  Beautiful!!!</td>', 'Perfect!!! title and image.  Beautiful!!!', '2012-09-03 22:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855744, 1031571, 150868, '<td valign="top">Can you be more creative with the title?</td>', 'Can you be more creative with the title?', '2012-09-03 22:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855745, 1031575, 150868, '<td valign="top">The title would work without the person in the image. The person doesn''t look forgotten. She''s too well dressed and clean and fit to look forgotten.</td>', 'The title would work without the person in the image. The person doesn''t look forgotten. She''s too well dressed and clean and fit to look forgotten.', '2012-09-03 22:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
