(6855971, 1031320, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene. I really am disliking the white vignette that was added. Takes too much away from the photo.</td>', 'Lovely scene. I really am disliking the white vignette that was added. Takes too much away from the photo.', '2012-09-04 09:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6855981, 1030782, 100831, '<td valign="top">For me, a very unnatural sight seeing the people waiting ON the tracks. Here, in the US, we never know when (or even IF) the train is coming so we take precaution NOT to be near the tracks (unless they''re not used any longer). <br/>Aside from that I like the use of high keyness here to match the clothing. <br/>All in all a high mark from me. Great job!</td>', 'For me, a very unnatural sight seeing the people waiting ON the tracks. Here, in the US, we never know when (or even IF) the train is coming so we take precaution NOT to be near the tracks (unless they''re not used any longer). Aside from that I like the use of high keyness here to match the clothing. All in all a high mark from me. Great job!', '2012-09-04 09:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
