(6856191, 1030949, 138630, '<td valign="top">I am not usually a fan of people and railroad tracks, even if the tracks are abandoned.  But having them beside the tracks works just fine for me :) and the light, tones and expressions are lovely.  One of my top five.</td>', 'I am not usually a fan of people and railroad tracks, even if the tracks are abandoned.  But having them beside the tracks works just fine for me :) and the light, tones and expressions are lovely.  One of my top five.', '2012-09-04 18:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
