(6857155, 1031231, 67697, '<td valign="top">I really thought this was fabulous, Bob.  The toning, perspective, and focus are spot on.  If this isn''t what you wanted I bet that something else had to be totally awesome!<br/> <br/>Congrats on 4th place!</td>', 'I really thought this was fabulous, Bob.  The toning, perspective, and focus are spot on.  If this isn''t what you wanted I bet that something else had to be totally awesome! Congrats on 4th place!', '2012-09-05 16:32:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(6857159, 1031508, 67697, '<td valign="top">This was my fave of the challenge.  I really liked that this one had a story to go with it.  Love the flare too.  Congrats on 5th place!</td>', 'This was my fave of the challenge.  I really liked that this one had a story to go with it.  Love the flare too.  Congrats on 5th place!', '2012-09-05 16:33:51.000000', NULL, 0),
