(6858544, 1031358, 38162, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nam:</b></div><hr/><i> I like this abstraction - nice textures, too.  Composition could maybe use a crop off the bottom so the horizontal isn''t so centered - but then again, maybe not.  Voted earlier. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>not</td>', 'Originally posted by nam: I like this abstraction - nice textures, too.  Composition could maybe use a crop off the bottom so the horizontal isn''t so centered - but then again, maybe not.  Voted earlier.   not', '2012-09-06 19:22:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6858547, 1030782, 38162, '<td valign="top">wonderful - makes me want to go back to india.  dont kill yourself but do stay with this theme.  gl.</td>', 'wonderful - makes me want to go back to india.  dont kill yourself but do stay with this theme.  gl.', '2012-09-06 19:24:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6858551, 1031493, 38162, '<td valign="top">speed voters?  nah.  chops for pushing the envelope here but it really is just way too much of your model - thus you error on the side of shoehorn.  again, you MUST try stuff like this to push the envelope.  oh well.   gl.</td>', 'speed voters?  nah.  chops for pushing the envelope here but it really is just way too much of your model - thus you error on the side of shoehorn.  again, you MUST try stuff like this to push the envelope.  oh well.   gl.', '2012-09-06 19:30:11.000000', NULL, 0),
